    "why": "Same reason as booking-staff: BookingWizard holds the step in React state via lib/booking-context and reads no searchParams, so ?step=datetime returns step one. The wizard has to be driven.",
    "stateMeasured": "The POPULATED state, a date picked and its time slots rendered. FLOORS LAW 3 makes the populated state the design target, so that is what the record below describes. The landing state, which is what a user actually sees on arrival at this step, is measured separately under bandAnatomy.landingStateBeforeADateIsPicked.",
    "steps": [
      "1 to 4. Everything in _measured/booking-staff.json reachedBy.steps, which lands on the staff step.",
      "5. On the staff step, click the row whose text contains 'Jonas' (aria-pressed flips to true on that row), then click Weiter. A named stylist was picked rather than leaving the pre-selected 'Keine Praeferenz' so the downstream steps carry a real stylist name, which the pay step's trust floor turns on.",
      "6. h1 becomes 'Datum & Zeit'. The date strip renders 14 day tiles, 27 Aug to 9 Sep. Five of the 14 are disabled for Jonas: 27, 28 and 30 Aug, 4 and 6 Sep. The time panel is the empty state until a date is picked.",
      "7. Click the day tile 'Mo 31 Aug', the first enabled tile more than one day out. It fills blue and 18 time slots render under 'Waehlen Sie eine Uhrzeit', split 'Morgens' 6 and 'Nachmittags' 12.",
      "8. Settle: sample the settle signature from scripts/measure-sections.mjs twice, 3 s apart. Both returned '70|2200|676'.",
      "9. Run the extractSections function body from scripts/measure-sections.mjs via javascript_tool."
    ],
    "inputMethod": "Same as booking-staff: clicks were dispatched as HTMLElement.click() through javascript_tool because mcp__Claude_Browser__computer left_click timed out after 30 s on three consecutive attempts and delivered no event. Hover and focus-visible states were therefore never exercised and nothing here describes them.",
    "notMeasured": "The waitlist route ('Kein passender Termin? Auf die Warteliste' opens WaitlistModal.tsx) was not opened. The slot-selected state of a time pill was measured separately, after this extract, and is recorded under bandAnatomy.slotPillSelected.",
